{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2201","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F1. Monotone Monochrome Matrices (Medium Version)"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"4 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This is the medium version of the problem. The difference between the versions is that in this version, the constraints on $$$n$$$ and $$$q$$$ are larger. You can hack only if you solved all versions of this problem."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"monochrome matrix"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of size $$$n \\times n$$$ is a matrix of $$$n$$$ rows and $$$n$$$ columns, where each cell is colored either black or white. Let the color of cell $$$(r,c)$$$ in a monochrome matrix $$$C$$$ be denoted as $$$C[r,c]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's call such a matrix $$$C$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"monotone"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if it satisfies the following condition:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" There exist no two rows $$$1 \\le i \\lt j \\le n$$$ and two columns $$$1 \\le k \\lt l \\le n$$$ that satisfy the following three conditions: "},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"kind":"list"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$C[i,k]=C[j,l]$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$C[j,k]=C[i,l]$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$C[i,k] \\neq C[j,k]$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There is a monochrome matrix $$$M$$$ of size $$$n \\times n$$$, where all cells are initially white. Please solve $$$q$$$ queries of the following kind:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$r\\;c$$$: Change the color of the cell $$$(r,c)$$$ in $$$M$$$ to "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"black"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". Then, determine if $$$M$$$ is monotone or not. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each query, it is guaranteed that the color of the cell $$$(r,c)$$$ was white before the query."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Do note that the updates are persistent. In other words, the change in color from one query affects the later queries as well."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line contains the number of test cases $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^3$$$). The description of the test cases follows. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$q$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 200\\,000$$$, $$$1 \\le q \\le \\min(n^2,200\\,000)$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the $$$q$$$ following lines contains two integers $$$r_i$$$, $$$c_i$$$ denoting the $$$i$$$-th query ($$$1 \\le r_i,c_i \\le n$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each query, it is guaranteed that the color of the cell $$$(r,c)$$$ was white before the query."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$200\\,000$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$q$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$200\\,000$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each query, output \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" or \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" on a separate line based on the answer of the query."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can output the answer in any case. For example, the strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yEs"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" will also be recognized as positive responses."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n3 9\n2 2\n3 3\n2 3\n3 1\n3 2\n1 1\n1 2\n2 1\n1 3\n5 17\n2 1\n4 5\n4 1\n3 3\n3 1\n3 5\n1 3\n1 5\n1 1\n5 3\n5 5\n5 1\n1 4\n5 2\n5 4\n1 2\n2 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYES\nNO\nYES\nNO\nYES\nNO\nNO\nYES\nYES\nYES\nNO\nYES\nNO\nNO\nYES\nNO\nNO\nYES\nNO\nNO\nYES\nYES\nNO\nYES\nYES\nYES\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, $$$M$$$ has size $$$3 \\times 3$$$. The states of $$$M$$$ after each query are as shown below."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$$$$\\quad\\, \\begin{bmatrix} \\square & \\square & \\square\\\\ \\square & \\blacksquare & \\square\\\\ \\square & \\square & \\square \\end{bmatrix} \\to \\begin{bmatrix} \\square & \\square & \\square\\\\ \\square & \\color{red}{\\blacksquare} & \\color{red}{\\square}\\\\ \\square & \\color{red}{\\square} & \\color{red}{\\blacksquare} \\end{bmatrix} \\to \\begin{bmatrix} \\square & \\square & \\square\\\\ \\square & \\blacksquare & \\blacksquare\\\\ \\square & \\square & \\blacksquare \\end{bmatrix} \\\\\\to \\begin{bmatrix} \\square & \\square & \\square\\\\ \\color{red}{\\square} & \\color{red}{\\blacksquare} & \\blacksquare\\\\ \\color{red}{\\blacksquare} & \\color{red}{\\square} & \\blacksquare \\end{bmatrix} \\to \\begin{bmatrix} \\square & \\square & \\square\\\\ \\square & \\blacksquare & \\blacksquare\\\\ \\blacksquare & \\blacksquare & \\blacksquare \\end{bmatrix} \\to \\begin{bmatrix} \\color{red}{\\blacksquare} & \\color{red}{\\square} & \\square\\\\ \\color{red}{\\square} & \\color{red}{\\blacksquare} & \\blacksquare\\\\ \\blacksquare & \\blacksquare & \\blacksquare \\end{bmatrix} \\\\\\to \\begin{bmatrix} \\color{red}{\\blacksquare} & \\blacksquare & \\color{red}{\\square}\\\\ \\color{red}{\\square} & \\blacksquare & \\color{red}{\\blacksquare}\\\\ \\blacksquare & \\blacksquare & \\blacksquare \\end{bmatrix} \\to \\begin{bmatrix} \\blacksquare & \\blacksquare & \\square\\\\ \\blacksquare & \\blacksquare & \\blacksquare\\\\ \\blacksquare & \\blacksquare & \\blacksquare \\end{bmatrix} \\to \\begin{bmatrix} \\blacksquare & \\blacksquare & \\blacksquare\\\\ \\blacksquare & \\blacksquare & \\blacksquare\\\\ \\blacksquare & \\blacksquare & \\blacksquare \\end{bmatrix}$$$$$$"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"On queries where $$$M$$$ is not monotonic, the four squares highlighted in red denote cells that violate the condition stated above."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F1","problemCode":"2201F1","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2201/problem/F1"}